 * previous detector was `/([^{}]*)\{[^{}]*outline:\s*none[^{}]*\}/` — `[^{}]*` cannot
 * cross a nested rule, so a declaration sitting in a block that ALSO contains `&`-nested
 * rules is invisible to it. That is not a corner case in this band: it hid
